    LLM: 'Six hands played in fixed order: 1. No tricks - each trick = 10 pts (130 total). 2. No hearts - each heart = 10 pts (130 total). 3. No queens - each queen = 25 pts (100 total). 4. No king of spades - Kâ™  = 100 pts. 5. No last trick - last trick = 100 pts. 6. Combination - all above penalties apply (560 total). Player left of dealer leads. Must follow suit if possible; if cannot, may play any card. Highest card of led suit wins trick. No trumps. Winner leads to next trick.',
